    [CI][Misc] Recalibrate Qwen3-30B-A3B-A2 performance baselines (#18694)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Prepare five repeated CI runs of `qwen3-30b-a3b-bf16-a2-performance` and
    `qwen3-30b-a3b-w8a8-a2-performance` on upstream main (`68e7c6128`).
    After collecting the results, recalibrate each throughput baseline using
    the mean of five valid runs and retain the existing 3% tolerance.
    
    Both performance baselines are set to 765 token/s for CI validation; the
    existing threshold remains 0.97.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce any user-facing change?
    No.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    Pending CI validation.
    
    Five repeated runs on the current commit (`697c5b860`): Run 1 (pending),
    Run 2 (pending), Run 3 (pending), Run 4 (pending), Run 5 (pending).
    
